{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13205200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13205200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1320520001:1":{"text":"親切に探すのを手伝ってくれて、本当にありがとう。","source_cn":"好心的孩子，谢谢你们帮我找回这些羊，还有萨莎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x562706C53DD65011","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320520002:1":{"text":"どういたしまして！でも、羊さんを見つけられたのは、サーシャさんのおかげなんですよ！","source_cn":"不用谢！都是多亏了萨莎，我们才能找回这只老羊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1034513C9273A06D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320520003:1":{"text":"はい。とても賢く勇敢で、まるで私たちの考えが理解できるみたいなんです！","source_cn":"是呀，萨莎又勇敢又聪明，似乎还能听懂我们说话呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD404D97C1229B435","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320520004:1":{"text":"君たちの考えを……？","source_cn":"能听懂你们说话……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DCB5F6C36631442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320520005:1":{"text":"そうなんです。首輪の鈴がなくて困っていると、サーシャさんが草むらに落ちていた鈴を見つけてくれました。","source_cn":"是啊，我们刚发现绵羊身上的铃铛消失了，萨莎就找到了掉在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB919AF17411D7B86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fema